 point where its frustrating. Save your money for now and just wait until they either update the game with a PVE mode or fix match making when the servers are slow. I love this game most of the time.. but when i hate it, i hate it.", "timestamp_created": 1781566334, "timestamp_updated": 1781566334, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503311276435852051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228061531", "author": {"steamid": "76561199207872753", "personaname": "Pork", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199207872753/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 17, "playtime_at_review": 181, "last_played": 1788580069, "avatar": "418314b6fd3820b177b8375b38935849a8e34fe5"}, "language": "english", "review": "game is very unique and fun \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1781564049, "timestamp_updated": 1781564049, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228061486", "author": {"steamid": "76561198451451906", "personaname": "Pr3acher420", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198451451906/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 19528, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 458, "playtime_at_review": 11139, "last_played": 1789083856, "avatar": "d251ecf34dd32ce770c99a6fefea7c9a0720f715"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love This Game", "timestamp_created": 1781563987, "timestamp_updated": 1781563987, "voted_up": true, "v